to read by taking advantage of these custom blocks, which we can now
我们现在可以把这些自定义积木叫做抽象。

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:38.540
call abstractions.
抽象就是把看起来很不一样或者在程序不同部分的东西——

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:42.308
Abstraction is all about taking things that look very different or that are
抽象就是把看起来非常不同或者在你程序不同部分的东西——就像我在四个地方都有那个IF条件，

00:15:42.308 --> 00:15:45.350
in different parts of your program-- like I had that IF condition in four
在你程序的不同部分——就像我在四处都设置了那个“如果”条件

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:46.880
different places in my program--
在我的程序里的不同地方——

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:50.570
and realizing that they're all just the same idea that I could give a name to.
然后意识到它们其实都是同一个概念，我可以给它取个名字。

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:53.660
And here, I can give a name to inflate and deflate.
在这里，我可以给“充气”和“放气”取个名字。

00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:57.210
And now just refer to those actions by their name.
现在就可以通过名字来指代这些动作了。

00:15:57.210 --> 00:16:00.530
So when the flag is clicked, we're going to set the size to 50%.
所以当点击旗帜时，我们要把大小设置为50%。

00:16:00.530 --> 00:16:04.520
We're going to inflate the balloon, wait one second, and deflate the balloon.
我们要给气球充气，等待一秒，然后给气球放气。

00:16:04.520 --> 00:16:08.970
You can just read exactly what it is that this project should do.
你可以直接看出这个项目应该做什么。

00:16:08.970 --> 00:16:11.120
And if in other places inside of my project
如果在我的项目的其他地方

00:16:11.120 --> 00:16:14.960
I later wanted to inflate or deflate the balloon, I could do that too.
之后我想给气球充气或放气，我也能做到。

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:17.180
I could add other blocks and other scripts
我可以添加其他积木和脚本

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:20.420
and just use inflate and deflate multiple times,
然后多次使用“充气”和“放气”，

00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:23.450
rather than need to repeat myself by saying repeat 10 times,
而不是每次想给气球充气时都要重复说“重复10次”，

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:27.590
change size by 10 every time that I wanted to inflate the balloon.
每次改变大小10。

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.960
So these blocks really helped to organize your code,
所以这些积木真的有助于组织你的代码，

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:32.930
help to reduce repetition and help make it clearer to someone
有助于减少重复，还能让看代码的人更清楚

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:36.230
reading the code what it is the code is doing.
代码在做什么。

00:16:36.230 --> 00:16:38.630
Now one thing is true, that these blocks are always
有一点是真的，这些积木总是

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:40.850
going to do the same thing every time.
每次都做同样的事情。

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:43.940
They're always going to repeat 10 times and change the size
它们总是会重复10次并改变大小

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:46.640
by 10, which will have the effect of increasing
每次改变10，这会使气球的整体大小

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:50.450
the overall size of the balloon by 100, 10 times 10.
增加100，也就是10乘以10。

00:16:50.450 --> 00:16:52.550
But maybe I'd like a little bit more control.
但也许我想要更多的控制权。

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:55.910
Maybe sometimes I just want to inflate the balloon a little bit,
也许有时候我只想给气球充一点气，

00:16:55.910 --> 00:16:59.540
and other times I would like to inflate the balloon a little bit more
而其他时候我想给气球多充一点气

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:01.100
or a little bit less.
或者少充一点气。

00:17:01.100 --> 00:17:03.530
So how could I do that?
那么我该怎么做呢？

00:17:03.530 --> 00:17:07.960
Well, let's go ahead and Control Click or Right Click on the Inflate block
好吧，我们继续，按住Control键点击或者右键点击“充气”积木

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.763
and now edit it.
然后现在编辑它。

00:17:09.763 --> 00:17:11.430
You'll notice that I've named the block.
你会注意到我已经给这个积木取了名字。

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:14.352
And I could change the name of the block now if I wanted to.
如果我想的话，现在也可以更改这个积木的名字。

00:17:14.352 --> 00:17:16.560
But when you make a block or when you edit the block,
但是当你创建一个积木或者编辑一个积木时，

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:20.280
you also have the ability to add input to that block as well.
你也可以给那个积木添加输入。

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:22.089
This block is now a function.
这个积木现在是一个函数。

00:17:22.089 --> 00:17:23.849
And we've discussed before that functions
我们之前讨论过函数

00:17:23.849 --> 00:17:29.110
can accept inputs, information that tells that function how to behave.
可以接受输入，也就是告诉函数如何运行的信息。

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:34.180
And so here, for example, I could add an input that would just be some number.
所以在这里，例如，我可以添加一个输入，它就是一个数字。

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:36.720
I'll call that number n, for example, which
例如，我把那个数字叫做n，

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:39.690
is just a convention for some number and for number.
这只是表示某个数字的一种惯例。

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:41.280
And let's add a label.
我们来添加一个标签。

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:43.920
We're going to inflate n times.
我们要充气n次。

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:46.170
This is just words that will describe what
这只是用来描述

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:48.690
it is the block is now going to do.
这个积木现在要做什么的文字。

00:17:48.690 --> 00:17:50.310
And now I'll press, OK.
现在我要点击“确定”。

00:17:50.310 --> 00:17:53.880
And what you'll notice now is that the Inflate block is now changed.
你现在会注意到，“放大”积木现在变了。

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:57.540
It's now Inflate and then a blank value times.
现在它是“放大”，然后有一个空白值和“次”。

00:17:57.540 --> 00:18:01.200
And that blank volume looks much like the blink value and change size
那个空白值看起来很像“改变大小”里的

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:04.590
by or move some number of steps, for example.
空白值，或者像“移动若干步”里的数值。

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:10.580
This is now a place where I can provide input into this function
现在这里是我可以给这个函数提供输入的地方

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:12.260
to tell it how to behave.
来告诉它该如何运行。

00:18:12.260 --> 00:18:14.960
And you'll notice now that under Define Inflate,
你现在会注意到，在“定义放大”下面，

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:18.470
it doesn't just say Define Inflate, but Define Inflate n times,
它不只是写着“定义放大”，而是“定义放大n次”，

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:22.730
where I have access to this block here called n.
在这里我可以使用这个叫n的积木。

00:18:22.730 --> 00:18:28.400
So what I'm going to do is take n and drag it inside of this repeat.
所以我要做的是把n拖到这个循环里面。

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:33.690
Instead of repeating 10 times every time, let's repeat n times every time.
不要每次都重复10次，让我们每次重复n次。

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:38.690
Whatever n is, where n is going to be the input to this function.
不管n是多少，n将是这个函数的输入值。

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:40.550
And I'll do the same thing with Deflate.
我对“缩小”也做同样的操作。

00:18:40.550 --> 00:18:41.930
I'll edit it.
我来编辑它。

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:47.700
And it will be deflate n and then add a label times.
它会变成“缩小n”，然后加上标签“次”。

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:49.500
And I'll say, OK to that.
我点击“确定”。

00:18:49.500 --> 00:18:52.560
And now instead of repeating 10 times and deflate,
现在不要每次缩小都重复10次，

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:56.590
let's repeat n times as well.
我们也重复n次。

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:59.100
Now these functions have the ability to take some input.
现在这些函数有能力接受一些输入了。

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:02.130
And you'll notice down below under the Inflate block,
你会注意到在“放大”积木下面，

00:19:02.130 --> 00:19:03.880
I need to type a number into this space.
我需要在这个空格中输入一个数字。

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:07.830
So I can say inflate 10 times and then deflate 10 times.
所以我可以说放大10次，然后缩小10次。

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:10.230
And now, if I run the project, it works the same way.
现在，如果我运行这个项目，它的运行方式和之前一样。

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:12.450
It inflates and then it deflates.
先放大然后缩小。

00:19:12.450 --> 00:19:17.490
But if I just change these inputs, inflate 20 times and deflate 20 times,
但如果我改变这些输入值，放大20次，缩小20次，

00:19:17.490 --> 00:19:20.610
well, now the project's going to behave differently.
那么，现在这个项目的运行方式就不同了。

00:19:20.610 --> 00:19:23.190
Inflate and deflate.
放大和缩小。

00:19:23.190 --> 00:19:25.200
It gets much bigger and then much smaller,
它会变得大很多，然后又小很多，

00:19:25.200 --> 00:19:29.050
because I'm inflating and deflating it more often.
因为我放大和缩小的次数更多了。

00:19:29.050 --> 00:19:30.970
And then I'll change these back to 10 for now
现在我把这些值改回10

00:19:30.970 --> 00:19:32.470
so we go back to the usual behavior.
这样我们就回到了原来的运行方式。

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:34.310
Inflate and then deflate.
放大然后缩小。

00:19:34.310 --> 00:19:36.490
But I could use these blocks in other places too.
但我也可以在其他地方使用这些积木。

00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:39.340
I could say, for example, that any time I
比如说，任何时候我

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:42.880
click on the balloon, when this sprite clicked, well, let's
点击这个气球，当这个角色被点击时，那么，让我们

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:47.860
like clicking inflate the balloon two times.
像点击一样，把气球放大两次。

00:19:47.860 --> 00:19:49.690
So not 10, a little bit fewer.
所以不是10次，次数少一点。

00:19:49.690 --> 00:19:51.910
So I press the flag and it inflates a lot.
所以我点击绿旗，它会大幅膨胀。

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:54.280
Inflates by 10 and then deflates.
膨胀10次，然后再收缩。

00:19:54.280 --> 00:19:58.090
But every time I click on the balloon, it's just going to inflate by a little.
但每次我点击气球，它只会稍微膨胀一点。

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:00.610
It's going to inflate two times.
它会膨胀两次。

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:02.770
And we were able to achieve all of that just
而我们能够做到所有这些，仅仅是

00:20:02.770 --> 00:20:05.230
by giving our functions some inputs.
通过给我们的函数一些输入。

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:08.860
We defined and inflate block, gave it an input n,
我们定义了一个“膨胀”积木，给它一个输入n，

00:20:08.860 --> 00:20:13.000
and then use that n inside of the definition of the block.
然后在积木的定义里使用那个n。

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:15.910
When we run the block, we're going to look at what is the value of n.
当我们运行这个积木时，我们会查看n的值是多少。

00:20:15.910 --> 00:20:19.030
And that's going to tell us how many times to repeat, such
这会告诉我们要重复多少次，这样

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:23.080
that now when we use that block, I can decide how much to inflate
现在当我们使用那个积木时，我可以决定要让气球膨胀多少

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:25.700
the balloon by just by saying, well, in this case,
只需要说，嗯，在这种情况下，

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:27.520
I want to inflate it 10 times.
我想让它膨胀10次。

00:20:27.520 --> 00:20:31.760
But down here, I only want to inflate it two times for example.
但在这里，比如我只想让它膨胀两次。

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:36.770
So you can make your blocks very customizable, very flexible as well.
所以你可以让你的积木非常可定制，也非常灵活。

00:20:36.770 --> 00:20:39.850
And these blocks don't just need to take one input.
而且这些积木不只是需要一个输入。

00:20:39.850 --> 00:20:42.620
They could also take multiple inputs as well.
它们也可以有多个输入。

00:20:42.620 --> 00:20:44.630
So let's see an example of that.
那么让我们来看一个这样的例子。

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:49.870
Let's go back to our bear, which we've had around before.
让我们回到之前用过的小熊角色。

00:20:49.870 --> 00:20:52.053
And you might recall that before, we've had a walk
你可能还记得，之前我们让它

00:20:52.053 --> 00:20:53.470
in a couple of different costumes.
用几种不同的造型走动。

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:56.410
If you go to Costumes, you see that we have this costume where
如果你打开“造型”，你会看到我们有这个造型，其中

00:20:56.410 --> 00:20:57.915
the bear is on four legs.
小熊是四脚着地的。

00:20:57.915 --> 00:21:01.340
And I'll go ahead and call that costume 4.
我接下来把那个造型叫做“4”。

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:04.010
And here, the bear is on two legs.
在这里，小熊是两脚站立的。

00:21:04.010 --> 00:21:05.720
And I'll rename that costume--
我要给那个造型重命名——

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:08.270
up in the name section, I'll call it 2.
在名称栏里，我把它叫做“2”。

00:21:08.270 --> 00:21:11.960
So I have a costume called 4 and a costume called 2.
所以我有一个叫“4”的造型和一个叫“2”的造型。

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:14.840
I just renamed those two default costumes.
我只是给那两个默认造型重命名了。

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:16.850
But now let me make a new block.
但现在让我创建一个新积木。

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:18.950
And here's what we'll call this block.
这就是我们要给这个积木起的名字。

00:21:18.950 --> 00:21:21.950
The block will be Walk.
这个积木叫“走动”。

00:21:21.950 --> 00:21:24.750
Then I'll add an input, which will be a number.
然后我要添加一个输入，它会是一个数字。

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:27.070
And I'm going to call it m for now.
目前我把它叫做m。

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:28.570
You can call this whatever you want.
你可以随意给它命名。

00:21:28.570 --> 00:21:30.420
This is just a name of an input.
这只是一个输入的名称。

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:36.390
And it's going to be a Walk m, and then I'll add some next, steps.
它会是“走动m”，然后我会添加一些后续步骤。

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:39.870
And then I'm going to say, on, and then I'm going to add a second input--
然后我要说“在……上”，接着我要添加第二个输入——

00:21:39.870 --> 00:21:42.510
a second input that I'll call n.
我把第二个输入叫做n。

00:21:42.510 --> 00:21:46.440
And then I'll add some text, feet.
然后我会添加一些文字“英尺”。

00:21:46.440 --> 00:21:49.350
So I added two inputs and two additional labels.
所以我添加了两个输入框和两个额外的标签。

00:21:49.350 --> 00:21:55.630
But this block is now called Walk m Steps on n Feet.
但现在这个积木块叫做“用n只脚走m步”。

00:21:55.630 --> 00:21:57.480
So what this is going to do is it's going
那么这个积木块要做的是

00:21:57.480 --> 00:22:01.810
to control how far the bear is going to walk on a certain number of feet.
控制熊用特定数量的脚要走多远。

00:22:01.810 --> 00:22:03.930
So what do I do about the number of feet?
那么对于脚的数量我该怎么做呢？

00:22:03.930 --> 00:22:04.920
Well, that's a costume.
嗯，这和造型有关。

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:08.220
There's a costume for four feet and a costume for two feet.
有四脚造型和两脚造型。

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:11.970
So let's switch the costume to m or n.
所以让我们把造型切换到m或n。

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:14.610
Well, n is the number of feet, and that's the costume.
嗯，n是脚的数量，也就是对应的造型。

00:22:14.610 --> 00:22:15.810
So n is going to go here.
所以n要放在这里。

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:19.920
We're going to switch to the costume to n, representing how many feet should
我们要把造型切换到n，以此表示熊现在应该用几只脚走路。

00:22:19.920 --> 00:22:21.540
the bear now be walking on.
现在熊要在上面走动。

00:22:21.540 --> 00:22:24.090
And now let's walk m steps.
现在让我们走m步。

00:22:24.090 --> 00:22:28.450
Well, I can walk one step just by saying, move one step.
嗯，我可以通过说“移动一步”来走一步。

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:32.350
And if I want to do that multiple times, I can put that in a repeat block.
如果我想多次执行这个操作，我可以把它放在一个重复积木块里。

00:22:32.350 --> 00:22:36.540
So let's go under Control and repeat the process of moving one step.
所以让我们到“控制”分类下，重复“移动一步”的过程。

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:43.800
But instead of repeating 10 times every time, let's instead repeat m times.
但不要每次都重复10次，而是重复m次。

00:22:43.800 --> 00:22:46.890
So this then is our definition of what does it mean
所以这就是我们对于

00:22:46.890 --> 00:22:50.640
for the bear to walk m steps on n feet.
熊用n只脚走m步是什么意思的定义。

00:22:50.640 --> 00:22:53.550
We first switched the costume to n, where is the number of feet.
我们首先把造型切换到n，n代表脚的数量。

00:22:53.550 --> 00:22:56.130
n is either going to be four or two to determine
n要么是四，要么是二，以此来决定

00:22:56.130 --> 00:22:58.170
which costume we should switch to.
我们应该切换到哪个造型。

00:22:58.170 --> 00:23:00.700
And then we're walking m steps.
然后我们走m步。

00:23:00.700 --> 00:23:04.920
So let's repeat m times this move one step block.
所以让我们把“移动一步”这个积木块重复m次。

00:23:04.920 --> 00:23:07.920
We've organized the logic for what it means for the bear
我们已经整理好了熊

00:23:07.920 --> 00:23:09.990
to walk on a certain number of feet.
用特定数量的脚走路的逻辑。

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:13.500
And now I can use that block inside of my project.
现在我可以在我的项目里使用那个积木块了。

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:18.270
I can say that whenever the flag is clicked, what should the bear do?
我可以说，每当点击旗帜时，熊应该做什么呢？

00:23:18.270 --> 00:23:19.920
Well, let's first have the block--
嗯，让我们先使用这个积木块——

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:25.650
or have the bear walk 30 steps on four feet
让熊用四只脚走30步

00:23:25.650 --> 00:23:32.450
and then walk 30 more steps on two feet.
然后再用两只脚走30步。

00:23:32.450 --> 00:23:36.590
So it's going to start on four feet, walk for 30 steps, then go to two feet,
所以它会先用四只脚开始，走30步，然后换成两只脚，

00:23:36.590 --> 00:23:37.400
walk 30 steps.
再走30步。

00:23:37.400 --> 00:23:38.650
And we can watch what happens.
我们可以看看会发生什么。

00:23:38.650 --> 00:23:39.560
I'll press the flag.
我来点击旗帜。

00:23:39.560 --> 00:23:42.335
It walks on four feet, and then on two.
